<Layout pageTitle="Maskless laser writer laboratory" subtitle="" description="Operate a metric reconstruction of the Heidelberg MLA 150 and calculate a direct-write dose map with stripe registration error.">
<article class="equipment eq-sheet mla" id="mla">
<nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/02-03/">← Equipment 02-03</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Equipment register</a><a href="#mla-evidence">References &amp; verification</a></nav>
<header class="eq-mast"><span class="eq-meta">02-03 / DIRECT-WRITE LITHOGRAPHY / MODEL 1.1</span><h2>Heidelberg Instruments MLA 150</h2><p>Manual-load · standard 150 mm exposure area · Write Mode II · 405 nm · vacuum chuck, electronics workstation and external chiller. Reference-informed educational reconstruction, not manufacturer CAD or real equipment control.</p></header>
<div class="mla-grid">
<section><div class="mla-head"><strong>01 / Instrument</strong><span id="mla-state" role="status">READY</span></div>
<div id="mla-view" aria-label="Interactive 3D MLA 150"><p>Loading metric model…</p></div><p class="small" id="mla-model-status">Loading glTF…</p>
<div class="mla-buttons">{['whole','front','right','rear','stage','chuck'].map(v=><button data-mla-view={v} type="button">{v==='whole'?'Reset view':v}</button>)}<button id="mla-cut" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Cutaway</button><button id="mla-glb" type="button" disabled>Export GLB</button></div>
<p class="small">Drag to orbit; pinch/scroll to zoom. Cabinet envelope is metric; loading slide and stage positions schematic. Cutaway is inspection only. The actual micrometer writing motion is too small to see at cabinet scale.</p>
<a href={base+'mla150.gltf'} download>Download glTF</a> · <a href={base+'model-source.mjs'} download>Editable model source</a>
</section>
<section><div class="mla-head"><strong>02 / Exposure job</strong><span>405 nm</span></div><div class="mla-buttons"><button id="mla-example" class="primary" type="button">Run ready example</button><button id="mla-reset" type="button">Reset</button><button id="mla-cancel" type="button" disabled>Cancel exposure</button></div>
<div class="mla-buttons"><button id="mla-light" type="button" aria-pressed="false">White light: OFF</button><button id="mla-window" type="button">Open window</button><button id="mla-load" type="button">Load coupon</button><button id="mla-vacuum" type="button">Engage vacuum</button><button id="mla-aid" type="button">Remove positioning aid</button><button id="mla-write" type="button">Expose</button><button id="mla-unload" type="button">Unload</button></div>
